{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You have the idea, we have everything else!</h2>TL;DR: Turn any idea into a movie in minutes! No prior experience required!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/0d44b2aa996c7dfd28a38e60228ec410.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/c145163ff776db790afefb538cce1c8e.poster.avif?t=1701043147\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/c145163ff776db790afefb538cce1c8e.webm?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/c145163ff776db790afefb538cce1c8e.mp4?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Grab an object \u2192 press record \u2192  move it around &amp; repeat! </strong><br>No need to watch hours of tutorials before getting into the action! Easy and straightforward to use with unique tools designed for VR that make animating fast, easy and fun! With Puppet Play EVERYONE can animate!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/f487c4b95cd800b30d96d513bb738a90.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/1e6ec79e2e00110ffb87ce086cf030c9.poster.avif?t=1701043147\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/1e6ec79e2e00110ffb87ce086cf030c9.webm?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/1e6ec79e2e00110ffb87ce086cf030c9.mp4?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose from a large selection of characters, props, items &amp; sets! Combine anything to create whatever you can think of!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/e5283211fa3bb9c8bd9fef6c3c69c8e9.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/2ee38cdef3ad00b9a344984bfc487957.avif?t=1701043147\" width=616 height=224 /></span><br>Import custom sound files (mp3) &amp; images (jpg, png) simply by drag and drop! Images can be attached to Puppets, like items, so they follow their movement!<br>More import options are planned for the future (3D objects, Sets &amp; of course characters!)<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/ef3534cc334f8a6eb2f31c2c06151d5d.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/efe4cb8165724670583f246c4212e818.poster.avif?t=1701043147\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/efe4cb8165724670583f246c4212e818.webm?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/efe4cb8165724670583f246c4212e818.mp4?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Animating is not your thing? Then why don't you just become the puppet? Motion Capture (Mocap) can be used on all humanoid characters. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/3042086f57926a41f24e75532f2ced9f.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/253c8abeed917ac50be01f8e8ef60152.poster.avif?t=1701043147\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/253c8abeed917ac50be01f8e8ef60152.webm?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/253c8abeed917ac50be01f8e8ef60152.mp4?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Move puppets over large distances! And have you ever tried to animate the hands after the body is already moving quickly? Trust me, its a pain! Use remote control to .... remote control limbs!<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/b0eddfb98eb1984b3254bdd8532a0fb0.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br>Once your movie is complete you can simply export it as a normal video (mp4) and share your masterpiece with everyone! Honestly can't wait to see what you will create :)<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/b621050af6398be4275e98f17868b203.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br>Puppet Play is being developed by a team of freshly graduated students from <strong>Hochschule Darmstadt University of Applied Sciences</strong>. Puppet Play started as a semester project in the study &quot;<strong>Animation and Game</strong>&quot; at the campus.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1666890?t=1701043147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1666890?t=1701043147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1701043147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1701043147","categories":[{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You have the idea, we have everything else!</h2>TL;DR: Turn any idea into a movie in minutes! No prior experience required!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/0d44b2aa996c7dfd28a38e60228ec410.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/c145163ff776db790afefb538cce1c8e.poster.avif?t=1701043147\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/c145163ff776db790afefb538cce1c8e.webm?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/c145163ff776db790afefb538cce1c8e.mp4?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Grab an object \u2192 press record \u2192  move it around &amp; repeat! </strong><br>No need to watch hours of tutorials before getting into the action! Easy and straightforward to use with unique tools designed for VR that make animating fast, easy and fun! With Puppet Play EVERYONE can animate!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/f487c4b95cd800b30d96d513bb738a90.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/1e6ec79e2e00110ffb87ce086cf030c9.poster.avif?t=1701043147\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/1e6ec79e2e00110ffb87ce086cf030c9.webm?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/1e6ec79e2e00110ffb87ce086cf030c9.mp4?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose from a large selection of characters, props, items &amp; sets! Combine anything to create whatever you can think of!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/e5283211fa3bb9c8bd9fef6c3c69c8e9.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/2ee38cdef3ad00b9a344984bfc487957.avif?t=1701043147\" width=616 height=224 /></span><br>Import custom sound files (mp3) &amp; images (jpg, png) simply by drag and drop! Images can be attached to Puppets, like items, so they follow their movement!<br>More import options are planned for the future (3D objects, Sets &amp; of course characters!)<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/ef3534cc334f8a6eb2f31c2c06151d5d.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/efe4cb8165724670583f246c4212e818.poster.avif?t=1701043147\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/efe4cb8165724670583f246c4212e818.webm?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/efe4cb8165724670583f246c4212e818.mp4?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Animating is not your thing? Then why don't you just become the puppet? Motion Capture (Mocap) can be used on all humanoid characters. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/3042086f57926a41f24e75532f2ced9f.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/253c8abeed917ac50be01f8e8ef60152.poster.avif?t=1701043147\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/253c8abeed917ac50be01f8e8ef60152.webm?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/253c8abeed917ac50be01f8e8ef60152.mp4?t=1701043147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Move puppets over large distances! And have you ever tried to animate the hands after the body is already moving quickly? Trust me, its a pain! Use remote control to .... remote control limbs!<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/b0eddfb98eb1984b3254bdd8532a0fb0.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br>Once your movie is complete you can simply export it as a normal video (mp4) and share your masterpiece with everyone! Honestly can't wait to see what you will create :)<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/extras/b621050af6398be4275e98f17868b203.webp?t=1701043147\" width=608 height=51 /></span><br>Puppet Play is being developed by a team of freshly graduated students from <strong>Hochschule Darmstadt University of Applied Sciences</strong>. Puppet Play started as a semester project in the study &quot;<strong>Animation and Game</strong>&quot; at the campus.","developers":["Unechte Sachen"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Audio Production","id":"52"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Education","id":"54"},{"description":"Video Production","id":"58"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666890/header.jpg?t=1701043147","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1666890/424541/022f1076f820417673e656779f0f6f1d62e7258f/1751016988/dash_av1.mpd?t=1639485211","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1666890/424541/022f1076f820417673e656779f0f6f1d62e7258f/1751016988/dash_h264.mpd?t=1639485211","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1666890/424541/022f1076f820417673e656779f0f6f1d62e7258f/1751016988/hls_